1	Confirmed — every `strokeDasharray` usage in the current-gen "Graphs" module family is only the `CartesianGrid` background grid (`5 5` dashed grid lines), not a hover reference line. There is no `ReferenceLine`, `activeDot`, cursor customization, or any dashed-vertical-line-plus-dot hover indicator anywhere in this codebase. The tooltip is purely the floating `GraphTimeTooltip` box rendered via recharts' default `Tooltip` positioning.
