167	  /* "Media frame" elevation — the shadow recipe every piece of inline
168	       case-study media shares (LoopVideo, LightboxImage, the Lightbox
169	       overlay, ProjectLayout's old embed box). Figma names this token
170	       "Light theme/Elevation" here and "Dark theme/Elevation" in .dark
171	       below — a flatter, single-tone drop shadow in light mode (no inset
172	       bevel; that only reads against a dark surface) vs. the dark theme's
173	       deeper shadow-plus-inner-highlight combination. */
