178	       it reads against the light page behind it, vs. the dark theme's
179	       near-black scrim below. Unlike --media-frame-shadow above, this one
180	       genuinely needs to flip per theme (the old dark-only rgba(24,24,27,.7)
181	       looked wrong once the rest of the page went light). */
182	  --lightbox-backdrop: oklch(98.8% 0.00852 67.7deg / 70%);
