185	       in Ping). Figma's dark-mode value (#3c3c44) is a light-on-dark gray
186	       border; in light mode there's no equivalent Figma frame, so this is a
187	       low-opacity tint of --portfolio-ink instead, kept subtle enough to
188	       read as a hairline rather than a heavy outline. */
189	  --section-border-color: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.15);
190	}
