/* Watchtower case-study "typing code editor" sandbox — scoped design
   tokens for the editor chrome (frame background, gutter, line numbers,
   wrap guides, cursor). Kept separate from watchtower-demo.css since this
   token set (editor chrome) is conceptually unrelated to the dashboard
   cards' tokens (chart colors, stat highlights) — same "one file per
   concern" split as undercurrent-demo.css vs. watchtower-demo.css.

   Values are translated from ~/.config/zed/themes/linear-dark.json's
   editor-chrome colors (dark) with a derived light companion (no
   linear-light.json exists to translate directly — see editorThemes.ts's
   comment for the same rationale applied to the syntax token colors).

   Only imported by TypingCodeEditor.tsx, so these rules never affect any
   other page. */

